          "title": "Back up your data",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>From the team's <strong>Settings</strong> menu you can easily back up the team's shared CryptDrive. When your mission ends, take a backup — you can upload it to your next Deploy App CryptPad server or another system as needed. Remember safe data handling!</p>",
